ry:"Payment summary",uaeTransferStep1:"Step 1: Copy & add the account details on the left as a beneficiary",uaeTransferStep2:"Step 2: Initiate local AED transfer to the same account",uaeTransferSaveOnFx:"Save on FX conversion",uaeTransferNoSwiftFees:"No SWIFT fees",uaeTransferFasterSettlement:"Faster settlement",uaeTransferWhyPayViaLocal:"Why pay via Local UAE transfer?",uaeTransferWhyPayBody:"Pay directly in AED from your UAE bank. No USD conversion, lower costs, no intermediary or SWIFT charges, and faster processing. The exact AED amount is shown using a fixed FX rate so you know what the exporter receives.",uaeTransferWhyPayBodyLong:"Paying via local UAE bank transfer lets you send AED directly from your UAE bank without converting to USD or using SWIFT. This usually means lower overall costs, no intermediary/SWIFT charges, and faster processing. The exact AED amount is shown on the invoice using a fixed FX rate, so you know exactly how much to pay and the exporter receives the correct amount without delays or deductions.",uaeTransferWhyPayBodyLongP1:"Paying via local UAE bank transfer lets you send AED directly from your UAE bank without converting to USD or using SWIFT. This usually means lower overall costs, no intermediary/SWIFT charges, and faster processing.",uaeTransferWhyPayBodyLongP2:"The exact AED amount is shown on the invoice using a fixed FX rate, so you know exactly how much to pay and the exporter receives the correct amount without delays or deductions.",uaeTransferWhyPayBodyLongMobileP1:"Paying via local UAE bank transfer lets you send AED directly from your UAE bank without converting to USD or using SWIFT. This usually means lower overall costs.",uaeTransferWhyPayBodyLongMobileP2:"The exact AED amount is shown on the invoice using a fixed FX rate, so you know exactly how much to pay.",uaeTransferSwiftVsLocal:"SWIFT vs Local UAE transfer (AED)",uaeTransferSwiftVsLocalShort:"SWIFT vs local transfer",uaeTransferSwiftColumn:"SWIFT transfer (USD)",